    {
      "source": "Items are sorted so that adapted beans are top (<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Servlet.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Servlet</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> then\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/EventListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>EventListener</code></a>) and direct <a href=\"ServletContextInitializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>ServletContextInitializer</code></a> beans are at the\nend. Further sorting is applied within these groups using the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/annotation/AnnotationAwareOrderComparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>AnnotationAwareOrderComparator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "项目按适配的 Bean 置于顶部（<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Servlet.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Servlet</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a>，然后是\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/EventListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>EventListener</code></a>），而直接的 <a href=\"ServletContextInitializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.servlet\"><code>ServletContextInitializer</code></a> Bean 置于末尾的顺序进行排序。在这些组内，进一步使用\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/annotation/AnnotationAwareOrderComparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>AnnotationAwareOrderComparator</code></a> 进行排序。",
      "count": 2
    },
